.TH MESHTASTICD-QUADRF 1 "August 2026" "quadrf-mesh 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
meshtasticd-quadrf \- Meshtastic daemon with an out-of-tree QuadRF adapter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B meshtasticd-quadrf
.RI [ meshtasticd-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
This GPL-3.0-only Meshtastic-derived daemon uses the QuadRF Air-IPC adapter.
The packaged systemd service invokes it through a state-preparation wrapper.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/meshtasticd/config.yaml
and
.I /etc/default/quadrf-meshtasticd
configure the service. Runtime state is under
.IR /var/lib/quadrf-meshtasticd .
.SH DISCLAIMER
This is an independent project, not an official Meshtastic support channel.
.SH AUTHOR
Roy C. Gross and Meshtastic contributors.
